{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 107,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Oh give thanks unto Jehovah; for he is good;\nFor his lovingkindness ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "endureth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " for ever.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let the redeemed of Jehovah say ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "so",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ",\nWhom he hath redeemed from the hand of the adversary,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And gathered out of the lands,\nFrom the east and from the west,\nFrom the north and from the south.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They wandered in the wilderness in a desert way;\nThey found no city of habitation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hungry and thirsty,\nTheir soul fainted in them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then they cried unto Jehovah in their trouble,\nAnd he delivered them out of their distresses,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He led them also by a straight way,\nThat they might go to a city of habitation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Oh that men would praise Jehovah for his lovingkindness,\nAnd for his wonderful works to the children of men!",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For he satisfieth the longing soul,\nAnd the hungry soul he filleth with good.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Such as sat in darkness and in the shadow of death,\nBeing bound in affliction and iron,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Because they rebelled against the words of God,\nAnd contemned the counsel of the Most High:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore he brought down their heart with labor;\nThey fell down, and there was none to help.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then they cried unto Jehovah in their trouble,\nAnd he saved them out of their distresses.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He brought them out of darkness and the shadow of death,\nAnd brake their bonds in sunder.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Oh that men would praise Jehovah for his lovingkindness,\nAnd for his wonderful works to the children of men!",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For he hath broken the gates of brass,\nAnd cut the bars of iron in sunder.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Fools because of their transgression,\nAnd because of their iniquities, are afflicted.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Their soul abhorreth all manner of food;\nAnd they draw near unto the gates of death.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then they cry unto Jehovah in their trouble,\nAnd he saveth them out of their distresses.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He sendeth his word, and healeth them,\nAnd delivereth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " from their destructions.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Oh that men would praise Jehovah for his lovingkindness,\nAnd for his wonderful works to the children of men!",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And let them offer the sacrifices of thanksgiving,\nAnd declare his works with singing.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They that go down to the sea in ships,\nThat do business in great waters;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These see the works of Jehovah,\nAnd his wonders in the deep.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For he commandeth, and raiseth the stormy wind,\nWhich lifteth up the waves thereof.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They mount up to the heavens, they go down again to the depths:\nTheir soul melteth away because of trouble.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They reel to and fro, and stagger like a drunken man,\nAnd are at their wits’ end.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then they cry unto Jehovah in their trouble,\nAnd he bringeth them out of their distresses.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He maketh the storm a calm,\nSo that the waves thereof are still.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then are they glad because they are quiet;\nSo he bringeth them unto their desired haven.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Oh that men would praise Jehovah for his lovingkindness,\nAnd for his wonderful works to the children of men!",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let them exalt him also in the assembly of the people,\nAnd praise him in the seat of the elders.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He turneth rivers into a wilderness,\nAnd watersprings into a thirsty ground;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.34",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.34",
      "verse": 34,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A fruitful land into a salt desert,\nFor the wickedness of them that dwell therein.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.35",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.35",
      "verse": 35,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He turneth a wilderness into a pool of water,\nAnd a dry land into watersprings.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.36",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.36",
      "verse": 36,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And there he maketh the hungry to dwell,\nThat they may prepare a city of habitation,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.37",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.37",
      "verse": 37,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And sow fields, and plant vineyards,\nAnd get them fruits of increase.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.38",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.38",
      "verse": 38,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He blesseth them also, so that they are multiplied greatly;\nAnd he suffereth not their cattle to decrease.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.39",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.39",
      "verse": 39,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Again, they are diminished and bowed down\nThrough oppression, trouble, and sorrow.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.40",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.40",
      "verse": 40,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He poureth contempt upon princes,\nAnd causeth them to wander in the waste, where there is no way.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.41",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.41",
      "verse": 41,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Yet setteth he the needy on high from affliction,\nAnd maketh ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " families like a flock.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.42",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.42",
      "verse": 42,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The upright shall see it, and be glad;\nAnd all iniquity shall stop her mouth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.107.43",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.107.43",
      "verse": 43,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Whoso is wise will give heed to these things;\nAnd they will consider the lovingkindnesses of Jehovah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
  "headings": [
    {
      "style": "ms1",
      "text": "Book V",
      "before_verse": 1
    },
    {
      "style": "s1",
      "text": "Jehovah delivers men from manifold troubles.",
      "before_verse": 1
    }
  ]
}
